      "language": "english",
      "review": "I play multiplayer with my daughter (cross play - me on my PC and my daughter on her Xbox) and it is an absolute  blast. As a parent, tbh some games I play with her just aren't fun to me (Minecraft, for example) but this game is not like that -- it is loads of fun. This game is top tier - the gameplay, combat, and especially the base building with the pals is a lot of fun. There's nothing I would recommend more for a family multiplayer game!",
